\"TEXT 28\",\"has_advanced_view\":false,\"translations\":[\"en\",\"cs\",\"es\",\"bg\",\"pt-br\",\"ru\",\"sk\",\"hr\",\"pl\",\"da\",\"de\",\"et\",\"fr\",\"hu\",\"ko\",\"lt\",\"nl\",\"sl\",\"uk\",\"ja\"]},\"next\":{\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/6/30/\",\"title\":\"TEXT 30\",\"has_advanced_view\":false,\"translations\":[\"en\",\"cs\",\"es\",\"bg\",\"pt-br\",\"ru\",\"sk\",\"hr\",\"pl\",\"da\",\"de\",\"et\",\"fr\",\"hu\",\"ko\",\"lt\",\"nl\",\"sl\",\"uk\",\"ja\"]}},\"child_items\":[{\"section\":\"devanagari\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.devanagari\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.DevanagariRecord\",\"title\":\"devanagari\",\"id\":1935,\"bb\":568131,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/6/29/devanagari/\",\"body_final\":\"सर्वभूतस्थमात्मानं सर्वभूतानि चात्मनि ।
ईक्षते योगयुक्तात्मा सर्वत्र समदर्शन: ॥ २९ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1936,\"bb\":1711,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/6/29/b1711/\",\"body_value\":\"sarva-bhūta-stham ātmānaṁ
sarva-bhūtāni cātmani
īkṣate yoga-yuktātmā
sarvatra sama-darśanaḥ\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":1937,\"bb\":1712,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/6/29/b1712/\",\"shadow_value\":\"sarva-bhūta-stham – situated in all beings; ātmānam – the Supersoul; sarva – all; bhūtāni – entities; ca – also; ātmani – in the Self; īkṣate – does see; yoga-yukta-ātmā – one who is dovetailed in Kṛṣṇa consciousness; sarvatra – everywhere; sama-darśanaḥ – seeing equally.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"sarva-bhūta-stham\",\"translation\":\"situated in all beings\"},{\"word\":\"ātmānam\",\"translation\":\"the Supersoul\"},{\"word\":\"sarva\",\"translation\":\"all\"},{\"word\":\"bhūtāni\",\"translation\":\"entities\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"ātmani\",\"translation\":\"in the Self\"},{\"word\":\"īkṣate\",\"translation\":\"does see\"},{\"word\":\"yoga-yukta-ātmā\",\"translation\":\"one who is dovetailed in Kṛṣṇa consciousness\"},{\"word\":\"sarvatra\",\"translation\":\"everywhere\"},{\"word\":\"sama-darśanaḥ\",\"translation\":\"seeing equally\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":1938,\"bb\":1713,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/6/29/b1713/\",\"body_value\":\"A true yogī observes Me in all beings and also sees every being in Me. Indeed, the self-realized person sees Me, the same Supreme Lord, everywhere.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1939,\"bb\":1714,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/6/29/b1714/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1940,\"bb\":1715,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/6/29/b1715/\",\"body_value\":\"Outwardly, also, every living being is situated in the energy of the Lord. As will be explained in the Seventh Chapter, the Lord has, primarily, two energies – the spiritual (or superior) and the material (or inferior). The living entity, although part of the superior energy, is conditioned by the inferior energy; the living entity is always in the Lord’s energy. Every living entity is situated in Him in one way or another.\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1941,\"bb\":1716,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/6/29/b1716/\",\"body_value\":\"The yogī sees equally because he sees that all living entities, although in different situations according to the results of fruitive work, in all circumstances remain the servants of God. While in the material energy, the living entity serves the material senses; and while in the spiritual energy, he serves the Supreme Lord directly. In either case the living entity is the servant of God. This vision of equality is perfect in a person in Kṛṣṇa consciousness.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 6.29\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 6.29\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L26\",\"$L27\",\"$L28\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"2a:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n30:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n26:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-