तस्याहं न प्रणश्यामि स च मे न प्रणश्यति ॥ ३० ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1944,\"bb\":1718,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/6/30/b1718/\",\"body_value\":\"yo māṁ paśyati sarvatra
