tasyāhaṁ na praṇaśyāmi
sa ca me na praṇaśyati\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":1945,\"bb\":1719,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/6/30/b1719/\",\"shadow_value\":\"yaḥ – whoever; mām – Me; paśyati – sees; sarvatra – everywhere; sarvam – everything; ca – and; mayi – in Me; paśyati – sees; tasya – for him; aham – I; na – not; praṇaśyāmi – am lost; saḥ – he; ca – also; me – to Me; na – nor; praṇaśyati – is lost.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"yaḥ\",\"translation\":\"whoever\"},{\"word\":\"mām\",\"translation\":\"Me\"},{\"word\":\"paśyati\",\"translation\":\"sees\"},{\"word\":\"sarvatra\",\"translation\":\"everywhere\"},{\"word\":\"sarvam\",\"translation\":\"everything\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"and\"},{\"word\":\"mayi\",\"translation\":\"in Me\"},{\"word\":\"paśyati\",\"translation\":\"sees\"},{\"word\":\"tasya\",\"translation\":\"for him\"},{\"word\":\"aham\",\"translation\":\"I\"},{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"not\"},{\"word\":\"praṇaśyāmi\",\"translation\":\"am lost\"},{\"word\":\"saḥ\",\"translation\":\"he\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"me\",\"translation\":\"to Me\"},{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"nor\"},{\"word\":\"praṇaśyati\",\"translation\":\"is lost\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":1946,\"bb\":1720,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/6/30/b1720/\",\"body_value\":\"For one who sees Me everywhere and sees everything in Me, I am never lost, nor is he ever lost to Me.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1947,\"bb\":1721,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/6/30/b1721/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1948,\"bb\":1722,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/6/30/b1722/\",\"body_value\":\"premāñjana-cchurita-bhakti-vilocanena
santaḥ sadaiva hṛdayeṣu vilokayanti
yaṁ śyāmasundaram acintya-guṇa-svarūpaṁ
govindam ādi-puruṣaṁ tam ahaṁ bhajāmi\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1949,\"bb\":1723,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/6/30/b1723/\",\"body_value\":\"“I worship the primeval Lord, Govinda, who is always seen by the devotee whose eyes are anointed with the pulp of love. He is seen in His eternal form of Śyāmasundara, situated within the heart of the devotee.”\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1950,\"bb\":1724,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/6/30/b1724/\",\"body_value\":\"At this stage, Lord Kṛṣṇa never disappears from the sight of the devotee, nor does the devotee ever lose sight of the Lord. In the case of a yogī who sees the Lord as Paramātmā within the heart, the same applies. Such a yogī turns into a pure devotee and cannot bear to live for a moment without seeing the Lord within himself.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 6.30\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 6.30\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L26\",\"$L27\",\"$L28\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"2a:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n30:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n26:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:px-8 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",nul